    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265640/extras/3ce1acb8c6eae4710e5c155f642afdbf.poster.avif?t=1753928265\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265640/extras/3ce1acb8c6eae4710e5c155f642afdbf.webm?t=1753928265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265640/extras/3ce1acb8c6eae4710e5c155f642afdbf.mp4?t=1753928265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X-Mode is a free-to-play medium paced multiplayer FPS with a variety of different gamemodes to play. Perfect for quick casual games with friends or if you're more hardcore you can grind for the top of the global leaderboard.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a variety of different gamemodes:<br>- Free For All <br>- Team Deathmatch <br>- Capture The Flag <br>- Infection <br>- Elimination <br>- Race <br>- Point Hold</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a selection of ranged and melee items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your player and rise to the top of the global leaderboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your items and player character to stand out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock all the Steam achievements</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265640/extras/86e1244b3bab4f201c1f51551e0544ad.poster.avif?t=1753928265\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265640/extras/86e1244b3bab4f201c1f51551e0544ad.webm?t=1753928265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265640/extras/86e1244b3bab4f201c1f51551e0544ad.mp4?t=1753928265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X-Mode was almost completely solo developed by xzippyachx, a solo indie developer making video games as a hobby since 2015. X-Mode started development in early 2020 and is their first game released on Steam. X-Mode's development process was also documented on YouTube.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265640/extras/3ce1acb8c6eae4710e5c155f642afdbf.poster.avif?t=1753928265\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265640/extras/3ce1acb8c6eae4710e5c155f642afdbf.webm?t=1753928265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265640/extras/3ce1acb8c6eae4710e5c155f642afdbf.mp4?t=1753928265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X-Mode is a free-to-play medium paced multiplayer FPS with a variety of different gamemodes to play. Perfect for quick casual games with friends or if you're more hardcore you can grind for the top of the global leaderboard.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a variety of different gamemodes:<br>- Free For All <br>- Team Deathmatch <br>- Capture The Flag <br>- Infection <br>- Elimination <br>- Race <br>- Point Hold</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a selection of ranged and melee items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your player and rise to the top of the global leaderboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your items and player character to stand out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock all the Steam achievements</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265640/extras/86e1244b3bab4f201c1f51551e0544ad.poster.avif?t=1753928265\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265640/extras/86e1244b3bab4f201c1f51551e0544ad.webm?t=1753928265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265640/extras/86e1244b3bab4f201c1f51551e0544ad.mp4?t=1753928265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X-Mode was almost completely solo developed by xzippyachx, a solo indie developer making video games as a hobby since 2015. X-Mode started development in early 2020 and is their first game released on Steam. X-Mode's development process was also documented on YouTube.</p>",
